{"post": true, "caption": "Leverage doesn't change how far price moves. It changes how much of that move hits your margin.\nMove that wipes out your margin = 100% / leverage. In practice, liquidation comes even sooner because of maintenance margin and fees.\nDecide what you can afford to lose first. Then size the trade. Leverage comes last.\n\nEducation only. Not financial advice.\n\n#CandleAndCode #TraderMath #Leverage #RiskManagement", "tag": "TRADER MATH", "footer": "Education only. Not financial advice.", "bpm": 92, "scenes": [
